<title>POLAND: EXBUD SIGNS $1.3 MLN COCA COLA DEAL.</title>
<headline>EXBUD SIGNS $1.3 MLN COCA COLA DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Exbud SA signed a $ 1.3 million contract with Coca Cola Poland Ltd for work on the firm's plant near the southern city of Krakow, Exbud said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Exbud has until May 31 to finish the project, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
